    "Faces and subjects stay in frame at every widget size. Fine-tune with a pinch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wajah dan objek utama tetap terbingkai di setiap ukuran widget. Sesuaikan dengan cubitan."
