    "Framed around what matters in the photo": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dibingkai di sekitar bagian terpenting foto"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Framed can only see the photos you’ve allowed. You can change this in Settings → Privacy & Security → Photos.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Framed hanya bisa melihat foto yang Anda izinkan. Anda bisa mengubahnya di Pengaturan → Privasi & Keamanan → Foto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Framed normally uses the system photo picker, so it only sees the photos you select.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Framed biasanya menggunakan pemilih foto bawaan sistem, jadi hanya melihat foto yang Anda pilih."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frames, filters & captions": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
