      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Layar Utama"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Home Screen widgets showing it will be empty until you make a new one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Widget Layar Utama yang menampilkannya akan kosong sampai Anda membuat widget baru."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Home Screen widgets showing it will switch to one of your other widgets.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Widget Layar Utama yang menampilkannya akan beralih ke salah satu widget Anda yang lain."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hourly": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tiap jam"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How to Add a Widget": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cara Menambahkan Widget"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you back up your device to iCloud or a computer, your widgets are included in that backup like any other app data.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jika Anda mencadangkan perangkat ke iCloud atau komputer, widget Anda ikut tersimpan dalam cadangan itu seperti data app lainnya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you have questions about this policy, contact us through the App Store page for Framed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jika ada pertanyaan tentang kebijakan ini, hubungi kami melalui halaman App Store Framed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you sync a widget with an album or turn on On This Day, Framed asks for access to your photo library. It reads the library only on your device, only to choose photos for those widgets. You can change this at any time in Settings → Privacy & Security → Photos.": {
      "localizations": {
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jika Anda menyinkronkan widget dengan album atau menyalakan Hari Ini Dulu, Framed meminta akses ke perpustakaan foto Anda. Perpustakaan hanya dibaca di perangkat Anda, hanya untuk memilih foto bagi widget tersebut. Anda bisa mengubahnya kapan saja di Pengaturan → Privasi & Keamanan → Foto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Importing %lld photos…": {
      "localizations": {
